<title>USA: Green Bay, Wis., $2.800 mln won by Robert Baird.</title>
<headline>Green Bay, Wis., $2.800 mln won by Robert Baird.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robert Baird said it won $2.800 million of Green Bay, Wis., general obligation developement bonds, Series 1997 B, with a true interest cost of 4.963 percent.</p>
